;;;;;; Martini lipid topology for di-C16:1-C18:1 PS (DOPS), generated using:
; The Martini lipid itp generator version 0.4  Args are: -o martini_v2.0_DOPS_01.itp -alname DOPS -alhead 'S P' -allink 'G G' -altail 'CDCC CDCC'
